Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: supersonic
Upstream-Contact: Sam Aaron <sam@sonic-pi.net>
Source: https://github.com/samaaron/supersonic
Files-Excluded: clockwork/external/ASIOSDK2.3.4
Comment: The Steinberg ASIO SDK (Windows-only; dual-licensed proprietary or
 GPL-3) is excluded from the Debian source tarball. It is not used on Linux.
 .
 SuperSonic is scsynth (dsp/scsynth, GPL-3+) running on clockwork
 (clockwork/, AGPL-3+ or a commercial licence). The combined program is
 AGPL-3+. clockwork is a git submodule of the upstream repository; the orig
 tarball carries its sources under clockwork/ (git archive of the pinned
 submodule commit), so the source package is the whole program.
 .
 The source package is assembled from three upstream tarballs:
 the main tarball (this repository with clockwork/ filled in), the "link"
 component (pristine Ableton Link 4.0 with its asio-standalone submodule;
 clockwork's patches under debian/patches apply to it), and the
 "rust-vendor" component (the output of `cargo vendor` for the committed
 rust/Cargo.lock, which resolves clockwork's crates by path). See
 debian/README.source.

Files: *
Copyright: 2025-2026 Sam Aaron <sam@sonic-pi.net>
License: AGPL-3+
Comment: The effective licence of the combined program. Individual first-party
 files carry SPDX headers naming their own terms: the scsynth glue and the
 host are GPL-3+, the JavaScript client files that predate clockwork are
 Expat or GPL-3+, and build scripts are Expat. All are compatible with, and
 subsumed by, AGPL-3+ in the built program.

Files: clockwork/*
Copyright: 2025-2026 Sam Aaron <sam@sonic-pi.net>
License: AGPL-3+
Comment: clockwork is dual-licensed upstream (AGPL-3.0-or-later OR a
 commercial licence). This package takes it under the AGPL.

Files: dsp/scsynth/synth/*
Copyright: 2002-2023 James McCartney and SuperCollider contributors
License: GPL-2+
Comment: SuperSonic's audio engine is a heavily modified fork of
 SuperCollider's scsynth server. Combined with the AGPL-3+ substrate the
 effective licence of the built binary is AGPL-3+.

Files: dsp/scsynth/synth/external_libraries/nova-simd/*
