 Works of US federal government employees produced in the course of their
 duties are not subject to domestic copyright protection (17 U.S.C. 105).
 The same file ships in Debian's existing supercollider package.

Files: clockwork/smoothie/*
Copyright: 2022 Raw Material Software Limited
           2026 Sam Aaron and the Sonic Pi Core Team
License: ISC
Comment: clockwork's audio-device layer — a vendored fork of the four
 ISC-licensed modules of JUCE 7.0.12 (juce_core, juce_events,
 juce_audio_basics, juce_audio_devices), maintained in the clockwork
 repository. Never synced from JUCE >= 8, whose modules are AGPL-3.0/commercial.

Files: clockwork/smoothie/modules/juce_core/zip/zlib/*
Copyright: 1995-2005 Jean-loup Gailly and Mark Adler
License: Zlib
Comment: Not compiled in this package: the build selects the system zlib
 (-DCLOCKWORK_SYSTEM_ZLIB=ON).

