Files: clockwork/src/vendor/stb/*
Copyright: 2017 Sean Barrett
License: Expat or public-domain
 stb_vorbis is dual-licensed by its author under the MIT licence or as
 public domain (Unlicense); this package takes it under the Expat terms.
